arrator","text":"I didn't dare step down from the road\nto walk level with him, but I kept\nmy head bowed like one who walks with reverence.\nHe began: \"What fortune or what destiny\nleads you down here before your final day?\nAnd who is this one showing you the way?\"","startTime":108,"endTime":123.76,"words":[{"word":"I","start":108.16,"end":108.24},{"word":"didn't","start":108.24,"end":108.64},{"word":"dare","start":108.64,"end":108.96},{"word":"step","start":108.96,"end":109.4},{"word":"down","start":109.4,"end":109.6},{"word":"from","start":109.6,"end":109.76},{"word":"the","start":109.76,"end":110},{"word":"road","start":110,"end":110.24},{"word":"to","start":110.24,"end":110.44},{"word":"walk","start":110.44,"end":110.64},{"word":"level","start":110.64,"end":110.96},{"word":"with","start":110.96,"end":111.12},{"word":"him,","start":111.12,"end":111.88},{"word":"but","start":111.88,"end":112.08},{"word":"I","start":112.08,"end":112.24},{"word":"kept","start":112.24,"end":112.4},{"word":"my","start":112.4,"end":112.68},{"word":"head","start":112.68,"end":112.88},{"word":"bowed","start":112.88,"end":113.4},{"word":"like","start":113.4,"end":113.6},{"word":"one","start":113.6,"end":113.84},{"word":"who","start":113.84,"end":114},{"word":"walks","start":114,"end":114.4},{"word":"with","start":114.4,"end":114.56},{"word":"reverence.","start":114.56,"end":115.68},{"word":"He","start":115.68,"end":115.893},{"word":"began:","start":115.893,"end":116.92},{"word":"\"What","start":116.92,"end":117.12},{"word":"fortune","start":117.12,"end":117.84},{"word":"or","start":117.84,"end":118.04},{"word":"what","start":118.04,"end":118.24},{"word":"destiny","start":118.24,"end":118.92},{"word":"leads","start":118.92,"end":119.12},{"word":"you","start":119.12,"end":119.32},{"word":"down","start":119.32,"end":119.52},{"word":"here","start":119.52,"end":119.84},{"word":"before","start":119.84,"end":120.12},{"word":"your","start":120.12,"end":120.4},{"word":"final","start":120.4,"e